01:06:46.640 --> 01:06:49.160
Sunday night at 8 on Cartoon Network. Hoo-ha!

01:07:06.490 --> 01:07:10.140
We'll fight these androids face-to-face, and I'll break them with my fair hand!

01:07:10.810 --> 01:07:12.610
Dragon Ball Z now continues.

01:07:18.230 --> 01:07:30.000
Be a lesson to those who do not pledge their loyalty to the great Vegeta.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:33.910
Hmm?

01:08:09.850 --> 01:08:16.680
Please forgive us. Please, sire, forgive us for ever doubting the incredible power of Vegeta.

01:08:16.680 --> 01:08:21.920
A lesson learned too late.

01:08:21.920 --> 01:08:25.800
Did you poor fools actually believe you had a chance against me?

01:08:25.800 --> 01:08:29.960
When will they ever learn?

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:34.040
Those who do not bow down before me shall suffer my wrath!

01:08:34.040 --> 01:08:38.140
With Frieza gone, I have no equal!

01:08:38.140 --> 01:08:42.160
I am the strongest fighter in the universe!

01:08:42.160 --> 01:08:48.630
But there is one I must find: Kakarot!

01:08:48.630 --> 01:08:50.710
Where are you?!

01:09:09.020 --> 01:09:15.970
For history!

01:09:16.310 --> 01:09:16.770
Oh!

01:09:33.420 --> 01:09:39.800
Ha, ha, ha, ha.

01:10:01.790 --> 01:10:04.840
It's a beam cannon!

01:10:30.350 --> 01:10:32.350
*evil laughter*

01:10:32.350 --> 01:10:36.380
*evil laughter*

01:10:36.380 --> 01:10:43.250
*evil laughter*

01:10:43.250 --> 01:10:45.250
Destructor Desk!

01:10:45.250 --> 01:10:47.990
What's this?

01:11:00.060 --> 01:11:02.820
- Yeah?

01:11:30.320 --> 01:11:31.250
Mm-hm-hm.

01:12:03.580 --> 01:12:09.340
Piccolo aren't you worried about Kami? I'd be worried if my mind and body were

01:12:09.340 --> 01:12:14.000
linked to that decrepit old prune. It would be such a tragedy if something

01:12:14.000 --> 01:12:20.130
happened to him, huh? You'd certainly have a tough time surviving without him. And with

01:12:20.130 --> 01:12:30.000
Kami gone, I bet you wouldn't talk so tough. If I were a coward like you, your words might

01:12:30.220 --> 01:12:38.010
scare me but I'm not what you want to see what real strength is that I'll show you

01:12:38.010 --> 01:12:46.600
you are watching Dragon Ball Z only tonight

01:13:03.680 --> 01:13:05.960
Mr. Popo, how much farther is it?

01:13:06.300 --> 01:13:07.600
We'll be there soon.

01:13:16.400 --> 01:13:21.560
Garlic Jr.

01:13:33.160 --> 01:13:35.160
I want to show you something!

01:13:35.160 --> 01:13:37.970
MY SOURCE OF POWER!

01:13:37.970 --> 01:13:45.940
THE HOLE!

01:13:45.940 --> 01:13:47.830
THE MACYO STAR!

01:13:47.830 --> 01:13:49.650
MY HOME!

01:13:49.650 --> 01:13:53.650
Its warm glow revives me and fills me with incredible strength!

01:13:53.650 --> 01:13:57.860
And after 12,000 years, it's made its way to Earth!

01:13:57.860 --> 01:13:59.510
Can you feel it?

01:14:01.630 --> 01:14:08.800
That the Macyo star has finally arrived, I will become ten times more powerful than I've ever been before!

01:14:08.800 --> 01:14:14.720
Hmm. There's nothing you can do to stop me from taking this planet for my own.

01:14:14.720 --> 01:14:16.770
Huh?

01:14:30.890 --> 01:14:34.290
I wish Garlic Jr. would give it a rest for a little while.

01:15:34.570 --> 01:15:37.450
This is the doorway that leads to the seven air currents!

01:15:37.450 --> 01:15:39.280
Open it! Go on!

01:15:39.280 --> 01:15:42.490
I'm trying! It's just that-

01:15:43.840 --> 01:15:45.750
It's open, Kame!

01:15:45.750 --> 01:15:46.610
Hmm...

01:16:07.900 --> 01:16:25.000
Go leave this place last time we thought you got lucky kid

01:16:25.280 --> 01:16:28.950
But now you're about to find out how powerful we really are

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:32.420
Yeah, so be afraid! Very afraid!

01:16:40.080 --> 01:16:53.400
This is it, Mr. Bobo! Let's do it!

01:17:07.480 --> 01:17:10.220
Doesn't look good for Piccolo, Gohan, and Krillin.

01:17:10.700 --> 01:17:13.360
Once again, Garlick Jr. has the upper hand.

01:17:13.870 --> 01:17:19.000
And with the Macchio star in Earth's orbit increasing his power, he seems unstoppable.

01:17:19.680 --> 01:17:22.390
Meanwhile, in the depths of their mystical lookout,

01:17:22.770 --> 01:17:29.490
Kami and Mr. Popo have found yet another obstacle standing between them and their last chance to save planet Earth.

01:17:31.560 --> 01:17:36.860
In the next Dragon Ball Z, Garland Jr. and his boys get a boost of power from the Macchio

01:17:36.860 --> 01:17:37.500
Star.

01:17:39.020 --> 01:17:39.280
Boom!

01:17:40.350 --> 01:17:44.380
Kami and Mr. Popo struggle to save Earth and stay alive.

01:17:44.380 --> 01:17:49.620
Don't miss the next exciting episode of Dragon Ball Z!

